# Build context for deploy/Dockerfile.gateway.
#
# Dockerfile-specific: applies only when the build uses `--file deploy/Dockerfile.gateway`.
# The gateway image installs the whole Bun workspace, so almost everything is wanted — what is
# excluded is what would bloat the context or poison the install layer.

# Repository metadata and local state. A stale host node_modules copied into the image would
# shadow the linux install (Bun installs platform-specific binaries), and .monaca/ holds
# fetched .node artifacts and a PostgreSQL data directory.
.git/
.monaca/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
target/

# Local env files. `.env.example` is kept (it is documentation); a real .env must never reach
# an image layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# The Rust side is not part of this image, and crates/ plus target/ are the largest things in
# the context.
crates/
target/

# Editor and OS noise.
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tsbuildinfo
coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/
